    "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/yikart/AiToEarn/tarball/v1.8.0",
    "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/yikart/AiToEarn/zipball/v1.8.0",
    "body": "Starting from version 1.8.0, we will discontinue updates for the Windows, macOS, and Android clients. Future development will focus on the Web version.\r\nTo continue using AitoEarn, please visit: https://aitoearn.ai/\r\n\r\nIn version 1.8.0, we introduced support for offline business scenarios, covering restaurants, retail stores, hotels and guesthouses, beauty and hair salons, gyms, and other types of physical businesses. This feature transforms offline promotional activities into executable online distribution tasks. Through content publishing and user participation mechanisms, it helps businesses gain more online exposure and in-store traffic.\r\n\r\n从 1.8.0 版本开始，我们将停止更新 Windows、macOS 和 Android 客户端，后续将集中资源持续迭代 Web 版本。\r\n如需继续使用 AitoEarn，请访问：https://aitoearn.ai/\r\n\r\n在 1.8.0 版本中，我们新增了对线下场景的支持，覆盖餐厅、零售店、民宿、美容美发、健身房等多种线下业态。该功能可将线下推广活动转化为可执行的线上传播任务，通过内容发布与用户参与机制，帮助门店获取更多线上曝光和到店流量。\r\n\r\n",
