feat(uptime): Optimize the status page and add support for new modules by @niuwenzheng in https://github.com/yikart/AiToEarn/pull/472\r\n* fix: Share development completed by @gaozhenqiang in https://github.com/yikart/AiToEarn/pull/473\r\n* fix(web): task chu pay y by @bulaienaofutuojiesenzhang in https://github.com/yikart/AiToEarn/pull/474\r\n* fix: fix eslint error by @gaozhenqiang in https://github.com/yikart/AiToEarn/pull/475\r\n* fix: Add hidden verification by @gaozhenqiang in https://github.com/yikart/AiToEarn/pull/476\r\n* fix(web): Added functionality to interrupt AI content generation tasks un close isok publish startus end by @bulaienaofutuojiesenzhang in https://github.com/yikart/AiToEarn/pull/478\r\n* feat: The interaction and integration of my channel and works have been completed by @gaozhenqiang in https://github.com/yikart/AiToEarn/pull/479\r\n* fix: fix agent ui by @gaozhenqiang in https://github.com/yikart/AiToEarn/pull/480\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/yikart/AiToEarn/compare/v1.4.6...1.5.0\r\n\r\n> 🧩 Version: **v1.5.0**  \r\n> 🗓️ Release Date: **November 2025**  \r\n> 💬 Feedback: [Report issues →](https://github.com/yikart/AiToEarn/issues)",
